WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.832 --> 00:00:08.512
This video shows you how to get back into your portal if you forget your password, or if the link in your welcome email has expired.

2
00:00:09.015 --> 00:00:17.855
Start on your portal's sign in page. School administrators and district administrators each have their own page, and they work the same way.

3
00:00:18.358 --> 00:00:30.328
First, type your email address in the email box. Leave the password empty. Then select Forgot your password. If you skip the email, the page reminds you to enter it first.

4
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:42.140
You'll see a message that says, if that email has an account, a reset link is on its way. We word it that way on purpose, so nobody can use this page to find out who has an account.

5
00:00:42.643 --> 00:00:48.373
Open the email and select the link. This one works for one hour, so use it soon.

6
00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:56.545
Choose a new password with at least eight characters, confirm it, and save it. You'll be signed in and taken to your portal.

7
00:00:57.047 --> 00:01:04.557
If you ask for a reset many times in an hour, the page will ask you to wait a little. Just use the most recent email.

8
00:01:05.059 --> 00:01:18.409
What if you open your original welcome link after seven days? The page tells you the link has expired, and it gives you a button to go to the sign in page and ask for a new link. The steps are the same as the ones you just saw.

9
00:01:18.911 --> 00:01:25.901
Still stuck? Email support at Fixer Nation Education dot com, and we'll send you a fresh welcome email.
